### Books REST API - Chapter 10 (MySQL/PDO)
### Use VS Code "REST Client" or import into Postman.

@host = http://localhost:8000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Public API
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Health
GET {{host}}/

### List books
GET {{host}}/api/books

### List books with pagination
GET {{host}}/api/books?limit=25&page=2

### Search books by title or author
GET {{host}}/api/books?q=clean

### Search with pagination
GET {{host}}/api/books?q=java&limit=10&page=1

### Show one book
GET {{host}}/api/books/1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. CRUD
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Create a book
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title":  "Refactoring",
  "author": "Martin Fowler",
  "year":   2018,
  "genre":  "Software Engineering"
}

### Update a book
PUT {{host}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year":  2009,
  "genre": "Software Craftsmanship"
}

### Delete a book
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Negative cases
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Book not found
GET {{host}}/api/books/999999

### Validation error - missing author and year
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Should fail"
}
